# .git-blame-ignore-revs
# Add commit SHAs here to exclude them from git blame output.
# These are typically large reformatting commits.
#
# Usage:
#   git blame --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs <file>
#
# Or set permanently:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Format:
# # Reason for ignoring
# <full-commit-sha>
